            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFT5dpw2zokdy0xMwnBlKXG2gjd\">The bar chart illustrates the proportion of government expenditure on road and transport in four different countries over a 15-year period, from 1990 to 2005.</div>\n</div>",
