          {
            "id": 512,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUbOdAIkcoo5AhxyGSClLi5BgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUbOdAIkcoo5AhxyGSClLi5BgPb\">Overall, there was a slight fluctuation in the percentage of spending in most countries throughout the period shown, with the exception of the Portugal, which saw a moderate decrease. Additionally, Portugal and Italy allocated significantly higher proportions of their budget to this sector compared to the UK and USA.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
